      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּ֫קַע</span></big>  <strong>substantivo</strong>[<strong>masculino</strong>] fração, <strong>metade</strong>, isto é, meio siclo, um peso; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּקַע מִשְׁקָלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:22\" href=\"/Genesis.24.22\">Gn 24.22</a>, cf. Hesíquio em Lag<sup>Ges. Abh. 199, 1. 18</sup> βακαίον [Lag βέκαον] μέτρον τι; ver também <span data-ref=\"BDB, בָּקַע\" data-bdbh-source-href=\"/BDB,_בָּקַע\" data-bdbh-suspended=\"LEXICAL_LABEL_TARGET_MISMATCH\">בֶּקַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:26\" href=\"/Exodus.38.26\">Êx 38.26</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲצִית הַשֶּׁקֶל</span>).",
