      "preview": "בִּקְעָה: substantivo feminino: vale, planície.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בִּקְעָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: vale</strong> (fenda), <strong>planície</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:2\" href=\"/Genesis.11.2\">Gn 11.2</a> + 8 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּקְעַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.3\">Dt 34.3</a> + 7 vezes; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּקָעוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.18\">Is 41.18</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:8\" href=\"/Psalms.104.8\">Sl 104.8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּקָעֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.11\">Dt 11.11</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>vale</em> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">הַר</span> monte) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.7\">Dt 8.7</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.11\">Dt 11.11</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.18\">Is 41.18</a>; também <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 63:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.63.14\">Is 63.14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּבְּהֵמָה בַּבִּקְעָה תֵרֵד</span>, no poema da criação <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:8\" href=\"/Psalms.104.8\">Sl 104.8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יַעֲלוּ הָרִים יֵרֽדוּ בְקָעוֹת</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>planície</em> (às vezes planície de vale, vale largo) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:2\" href=\"/Genesis.11.2\">Gn 11.2</a>; também <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.22\">Ez 3.22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.23\">Ez 3.23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.4\">Ez 8.4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 37:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.37.1\">Ez 37.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 37:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.37.2\">Ez 37.2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(עַל־פְּנֵי הַבּ׳)</span> como terreno plano, oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">הָֽרְכָסִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.4\">Is 40.4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִישׁוֹר</span>); nos demais casos, construto, sobretudo com nome próprio <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.3\">Dt 34.3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ יְרֵחוֹ</span> (em aposição a <span dir=\"rtl\">הַכִּכָּר</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ מִצְפֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:8\" href=\"/Joshua.11.8\">Js 11.8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ הַלְּבָנוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:17\" href=\"/Joshua.11.17\">Js 11.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:7\" href=\"/Joshua.12.7\">Js 12.7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ מִגִדּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.22\">2Cr 35.22</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.11\">Zc 12.11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ אוֹנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.2\">Ne 6.2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳־אָוֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:5\" href=\"/Amos.1.5\">Am 1.5</a> <em>planície da idolatria</em> = Baalbek (Damasco, segundo Wetzst em De<sup>Jes 3, 702</sup>; 𝔊 πέδιον Ὤν).",
